# AgentPR Documentation Rule

After making any changes to the AgentPR project, update `README.md` to reflect:
- New companies added to monitoring
- Changes to filtering logic or thresholds  
- New sources added to `sources.py`
- Changes to Telegram message format
- Changes to Google Sheet schema
- Changes to the bot behavior or system prompt
- Any new environment variables or secrets required

Keep the README accurate and current — it is the single source of truth for how the system works.
